title: "Dy3DGS Thesis Repro: Controlled Comparison of Dynamic-Aware 3D Gaussian Splatting"
abstract: "A self-contained, dependency-light reproduction harness that isolates the effect of dynamic-mask-weighted loss versus dynamic-point initialization filtering in 3D Gaussian Splatting under a synthesized dynamic scene with exact ground truth."
